{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act38side_level_act38side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act38side",
  "stageId": "act38side_04",
  "title": "體面來賓",
  "storyCode": "PV-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "634c4dd8dfcc5a553748887736a49b62cb5812291cfca7f785fe419baf30a0b5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "56_g7_tailorshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>1100年11月7日    11:40 A.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗女士，你剛剛說，那孩子其實是被威尼斯家族的人帶走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我消息的那個人沒有欺騙我的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧奇諾當天晚上確實去了港口區，聽說當時那裡發生了一場車禍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我當時也在離現場不遠的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概和威尼斯家族脫不了關係，如果沒猜錯的話，盧奇諾應該是正好發現了一些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗女士，請你離開吧，我今天得提前關店了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要自己去找小威尼斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "翁貝托，我不知道你過去是怎樣的人。但我相信，即使是瓦古選中的人，也拿衰老沒什麼辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個病弱的老裁縫，可能連小威尼斯宅邸的門都進不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果盧奇諾真知道了他不該知道的事情，那他可能沒辦法再從威尼斯家出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗女士，我已經垂垂老矣，哪怕沒發生這件事，我也快走到人生的盡頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非要說我還有什麼無法放下的事情，也就是這孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是我唯一的親人，這也不算什麼，但誰讓我是他唯一的親人呢。他還那麼小，在孩子的事上，我們總是沒什麼辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，威尼斯家，對我來說也沒那麼陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我還隱瞞了你一件事——我其實算是你的前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這算是，瓦古選擇我的理由吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉，兜兜轉轉一大圈，結果又繞了回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和你一起去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗女士……這件事本身和你沒什麼關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你發現了那孩子的線索，主動來告知我，我已經很感激了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為麗薩小姐的事，你當時和威尼斯家族鬧得非常不愉快，貿然回去的話，想必會有不少麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個用不著你操心，我與瓦古有約在先。在當年的事情水落石出之前，你沒有資格出事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我很理解一個人為了自己的孩子會願意付出什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g11_mansionhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……有人來了嗎？我能離開了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子的聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛是你在說話嗎，孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在害怕我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求求您，能不能讓我回家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是碰巧來這裡做客，恐怕沒辦法插手主人家的事。是什麼原因讓他們把你留在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我不知道。如果、如果您也沒辦法做主……能否替我通知德蒙塔諾裁縫店的翁貝托·德蒙塔諾一聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "翁貝托……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是我的爺爺，我離開太久了他會擔心。還有我從藥店幫他拿的藥，他很需要那些，如果我不能、不能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在擔心你的爺爺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟著我吧，威尼斯家向來不會為難客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒想到，我來這一趟還能遇到其他意料之外的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好在，我喜歡熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這麼跟著您走嗎……外面那些人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們也正忙著招待我這個客人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾緊緊跟在老人的身後，一路上竟然沒有遇到任何一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……您、您到底是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟好了，孩子，這棟宅子很大的。我們馬上就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛不是說，有很多事想要我幫忙轉告給你的爺爺嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我的年齡大了，記性實在糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我想你可以親口告訴他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老翁貝托，我真羡慕你有一個愛你的孫子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺、爺爺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾有一肚子問題——他是不是耽誤了德蒙塔諾的生意？這兩天爺爺是不是特別擔心？爺爺又是怎麼知道自己被抓來了這裡？\n但爺爺只是看了自己一眼，除此之外沒有任何回應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坐吧，翁貝托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了，我的腿腳沒過去那麼好了，坐下容易，站起來可就難了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說，是英格麗陪你來的……她在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她得知是您找到了盧奇諾後就離開了，她很信任您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什麼時候從蒙特盧佩搬走的？也沒跟我說一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是覺得，沒有必要通知您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你衰老得很厲害。聽這孩子的說法，你生病了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算嚴重但也麻煩。眼睛和耳朵不怎麼靈了，腰、腿、肩膀這些部位的關節也老是痛……職業病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人上了年紀總會這樣，就像品質再好、保養得再仔細的布料，時間一長也難免變脆變硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，照顧好你爺爺，不要讓自己留下遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也沒想到能在這見到您，還有這孩子的事……給您添麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "談不上，我來參加狂歡節，然後就撞上了你的孫子來這裡做客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，盧奇諾，交給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼奧這件事做得不夠體面，我已經讓人去找他來向你解釋緣由了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安東尼奧……在敘拉古，這是個再普通不過的名字。但此刻，盧奇諾只會把它和一個人畫上等號——\n安東尼奧·威尼斯，威尼斯載具公司的話事人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……安東尼奧先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以為這件事會更麻煩一點，但既然您都已經出面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "翁貝托，你沒有過去那般有耐心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼奧總歸得給個說法，我也放心一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你願意陪我見見這裡的主人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……爺爺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒有拒絕的可能，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就當給老主顧一個面子吧，老夥計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前有人找過我，希望我為您做一套禮服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如，就趁著現在，我為您準備一套新套裝吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說到時候陣仗很大，穿戴著假面和華服的民眾會簇擁著巨型花車巡遊全城。您肯定不會缺席，您需要一身禮服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去，我記得每一位常客的尺碼，但您看，歲月不饒人，我們都有了很大的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也越來越依賴盧奇諾替我記下我常常遺忘的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好，在安東尼奧來之前，我們還有時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧奇諾，我們恐怕得再等等才能回家了，你還能撐得住嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事的，爺爺！我能幫上什麼忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去把我隨身帶著的工具箱拿來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為這位先生準備檔案銘牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，老先生，我一直不知道您的名字……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“法布里齊奧·威尼斯”。\n老人簽下了自己的名字，交到盧奇諾的手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您、您是……但為什麼要說自己是客人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓，盧奇諾，什麼話也別說，按我說的做，也只做我們該做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，法布里齊奧先生就只是我們的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，能讓這孩子做我的幫手嗎？他一直期望能為一位真正重要的客人服務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "過去，如此重要的客人，爺爺任何一個步驟都拒絕讓自己參與。\n但現在，翁貝托指導著他做每一項準備工作，甚至鼓勵他自己動手。\n“你需要表達對客人的尊敬和感謝”，爺爺是這樣說的……\n一切都順理成章且無比自然，就好像從未發生過那場綁架，而爺爺也不是為救自己而來。\n只是一次工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這孩子的手和你一樣穩。將來，他也會成為一名“剪裁師”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“剪裁師”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老翁貝托，看來你並沒有告訴過這孩子你的過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g5_srcpark"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，你不準備進去見見爸爸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有老爺在，翁貝托和盧奇諾都會很安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只需要確保他們走出大門後能安穩地離開這裡就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我的意思不是這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在需要見他的人應該是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把一個無辜的孩子牽扯進家族的事務，我不記得老爺以前會如此行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那孩子並非我下令帶回家族的。但我也不想否認，如果他的存在真的會威脅到家族的利益，我會做出同樣的決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家族的利益，還是你的利益？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩者有什麼區別嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的確變了許多，安東尼奧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，是你離開太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是敘拉古的第二十三座移動城市，一片尚未被開墾的沃土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我是那個在這片土地上撒下種子的人，我有義務保證它的豐收，無論用什麼手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也是我迫切希望你能回來的原因，我知道你能做到什麼，家裡需要你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東，老爺不會喜歡這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，他會生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他剛剛命令我去見他，我能猜到他會教訓我一頓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你以為他憤怒的原因會是我把一個無辜的孩子牽扯進來嗎？他根本不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他只是憤怒我這件事做得不夠隱蔽，不夠“體面”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會用實際的成績向爸爸證明，在新沃爾西尼，威尼斯可以建立兩套並行不悖的秩序——地上的、地下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這優先依靠的，肯定不是所謂的“體面”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕這會讓老爺傷心，讓信任你的人傷心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我愛爸爸，他給了我一切。我想這就是最好的回報，不管代價是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，你說錯了一件事，英格麗，我從來都沒變過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……從來都沒變過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“剪裁師”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今的德蒙塔諾已經不再提供這項服務了，這孩子沒必要知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，我依舊記得你過去的風采，你曾替我解決了許多許多麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時蒙特盧佩的家族無不忌憚那個神出鬼沒的“剪裁師”，只要在訂單上寫下目標的名字，隔天他的死訊就會出現在報紙上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……都是為了報答您的恩情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我還只是個和盧奇諾差不多大的小裁縫的時候，是您救了我，給了我在蒙特盧佩活下去的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎樣，你都值得一個體面的終局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您一直很照顧我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾覺得自己頭很痛。\n他們談論的的確是自己的爺爺，但他怎麼都無法和眼前的老人聯繫起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，這孩子的父母呢？你的兒子——是叫盧卡對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。盧卡·德蒙塔諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "父母？盧奇諾似乎問過爺爺這個問題，老人卻從來沒有正面回應過。\n他試圖從爺爺的眼神中理解爺爺的意圖，但爺爺只是專注於手上的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧卡是個好孩子，很好的孩子，懂事，在剪裁上很有天賦，也肯吃苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他二十多歲的時候，業務上就已經很熟練了，老主顧們也喜歡他，我當時已經有了將德蒙塔諾交給他經營的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到有一天清晨，他的屍體在一輛出城的載具上被發現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的身邊躺著一個歌舞劇女演員，在蒙特盧佩小有名氣，受到許多家族成員的追捧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧奇諾，你的手抖了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……要休息一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去把布料的樣品取來吧，這裡我處理得過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好、好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對那個孩子有一點殘忍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我活不久了，先生。這意味著我沒辦法一直保護他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧卡的死，讓我意識到了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕時沾的血，是經手過多少布料也沒辦法擦乾淨的。那些血腥味會把不幸引向我和我的家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而那孩子，卻對所謂的“大人物”有著不切實際的幻想。這是我的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼奧先生也好，您也罷，又或許是其他家族成員，盧奇諾遲早會遇上你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他總得知道這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你將盧卡的死視作自己應受的懲罰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是代價……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，請您抬下頭，我要開始量頸圍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有時候爺爺在操作台邊待的時間稍微長一點後，甚至會止不住地手抖。\n他不只一次地調侃過，盧奇諾要是再不快點學會自己的手藝，德蒙塔諾就得關門大吉了。\n但現在爺爺的手前所未有地穩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾看著他拉開皮尺，從老威尼斯的肩膀開始，一步步量過對方的手臂、胸膛、腰身和雙腿。\n但盧奇諾知道，爺爺的注意力一直都在自己的身上。\n可惜他尚未做好接受真相的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失去盧卡之後，我才得知了盧奇諾的存在，他一直被盧卡寄養在郊野的農莊裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是在那時才確切地知道了，盧卡是怎樣透過一份劇院的訂單、一件演出服和一位女演員結了緣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎樣為了不讓我擔心，不惹上更大的麻煩，瞞著所有人一點點經營起不被允許的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是怎樣為他們自己、為我這個老傢伙留下了這一點希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，盧奇諾這孩子已是盧卡留給我的，最後僅剩的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論您和安東尼奧先生的打算是什麼，我懇求您，不要再將他牽扯進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（爺爺……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾不知道該以何種心情面對這件事。\n父母離世的真相、爺爺的過去、自己的未來……龐雜的情緒淹沒了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請您抬一下手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我並不是在祈求您為我做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是很自私地想著，多給這孩子一點時間，讓他能好好審視一下一個裁縫的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何量身、如何裁衣、如何禮貌地接待客戶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，如何遠離原就不屬於他的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，好吧。看來你真的下定決心與過往的一切做告別了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這套衣服完成後不必親自送來了，我會讓人去你的店裡拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "翁貝托，若是你想要回蒙特盧佩故地重遊，一定別忘了還有我這麼個老傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g5_srcpark"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你絕不會放盧奇諾那孩子離開……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕老爺都已經同意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，哪怕那孩子保證自己不會亂說，我也沒辦法確定市政廳會不會從他那聽到一些荒唐的流言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多家族都盯著威尼斯，我沒辦法冒這個險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸會理解我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，也請你為家族想想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一頭狼請我完成一個約定，我為了女兒的事情再次回到了這個國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的憤怒早就不為家族而燃燒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今我只為我自己，安東。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真遺憾，那我們恐怕沒有好好商量的餘地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得這些人能攔下我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只需要確認那個孩子乖乖閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東，回答我一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你保釋我時，說知道傷害麗薩的兇手是誰，這是不是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……千真萬確，我從不騙你，英格麗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我送麗薩離開敘拉古之後，其實暗中調查了很久，雖然一無所獲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我一直有些自己都不願承認的猜測。不過，至少現在，恐怕你不會說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……現在，原諒我沒辦法告訴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了，我會知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刀鋒落在安東尼奧的鼻尖，但安東尼奧卻在微笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，你知道在家裡，我們的一舉一動都被人盯著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這樣的行為實在不夠體面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，看在我的面子上，請把刀放下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不見了，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
